====== Buffalo LinkStation LS421DE ======
{{:media:buffalo:ls421de:ls421de.png?nolink&200}}

This is a low-cost dual-port SATA NAS box.
It comes with one 1GbE network port, one USB 2.0 host port on the back and one USB 3.0 on the front.

